  FT["MY-H3774"] = {"id":"MY-H3774","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 284/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年消费税（纳闽）令","en":"EXCISE DUTIES (LABUAN) ORDER 2016","orig":"EXCISE DUTIES (LABUAN) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Duti Eksais (Labuan) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tiêu thụ đặc biệt (Labuan) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งภาษีสรรพสามิต (ลาบวน) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Cukai (Labuan) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA284","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2016_P.U.(A)284-2016_EXCISE DUTIES (LABUAN) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3774-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Eksais (Labuan) 2016.\n\n     (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 November 2016.\n\nDuti-duti Eksais"}},{"id":"MY-H3774-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2.  Duti-duti eksais hendaklah dikenakan ke atas d an dibayar oleh pengimport\nberkenaan dengan liquor yang memabukkan, produk tembakau dan rokok yang\ndiimport ke dalam Labuan mengikut kadar -kadar yang dinyata kan dalam  ruang 4\nJadual kepada Perintah Duti Eksais yang sedang berkuat kuasa.\n\nDibuat 31 Oktober 201 6\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/12-4 Sk. 10; Perb.  CR(8.20)116/1-138(2016)(SJ.8)(SK.1);\nPN(PU2)337]\n\nDATUK JOHARI BIN ABDUL GHANI\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 90A (2) Akta Eksais 1976]\n\nEXCISE ACT 1976\n\nEXCISE DUTIES (LABUAN) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by  paragraph 90A(1)(a) of the\nExcise  Act  1976 [Act 176], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-8"};
  FT["MY-H3775"] = {"id":"MY-H3775","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 284/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第33号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 33) ORDER 2017","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 33) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 33) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 33) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 33) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 33) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA284","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2017_P.U.(A)284-2017_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 33) ORDER 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3775-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 33) 2017.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H3775-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan ketenteraman awam dan\n\nyang mungkin menggemparkan fikiran orang ramai adalah dilarang secara mutlak\n\ndi seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang Penerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\nUlama Yang Bukan\n\nPewaris Nabi\n\nWan Ji Wan Hussin Ilham Books\n\n(SA0293237-A)\n\nNo. 23, Jalan 19/17,\n\nSeksyen 19,\n\n46300 Petaling Jaya,\n\nSelangor\n\nVinlin Press\n\nSdn. Bhd.\n\nMelayu\n\nDibuat 6 September 2017\n\n[KDN.PQ.S. 600-16/15/49; PN(PU2)417/XXII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 33) ORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the\n\nPrinting Presses and Publications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the\n\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications\n\n(Control of Undesirable Publications) (No. 33) Order 2017.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to public order and likely to alarm public opinion is\n\nabsolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor Publisher Printer Language\n\nUlama Yang Bukan\n\nPewaris Nabi\n\nWan Ji Wan Hussin Ilham Books\n\n(SA0293237-A)\n\nNo. 23, Jalan 19/17,\n\nSeksyen 19,\n\n46300 Petaling Jaya,\n\nSelangor\n\nVinlin Press\n\nSdn. Bhd.\n\nMalay\n\nMade 6 September 2017\n\n[KDN.PQ.S. 600-16/15/49; PN(PU2)417/XXII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-8"};
  FT["MY-H3776"] = {"id":"MY-H3776","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 284/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年价格管制与反暴利（最高价格核定）（第4号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 4) ORDER 2018","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 4) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Bilangan 4) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá tối đa) (số 4) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาสูงสุด) (ฉบับที่ 4) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Nomor 4) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA284","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2018_P.U.(A)284-2018_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 4) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H3776-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Maksimum) (No. 4) 2018.\n\n (2)  Perintah ini b erkuat kuasa bagi tempoh dari 3 November 2018\nhingga 9 November 2018.\n\nHarga pengeluar maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H3776-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga pengeluar maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Pertama bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia,\nNegeri Sarawak, Negeri Sabah dan Wila yah-Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut\nkawasan dan daerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga borong maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H3776-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Harga borong maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Kedua bagi Negeri -Negeri di Seme nanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan dan\ndaerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga runcit maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H3776-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Harga runcit maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyataka n dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Ketiga bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah -Wilayah Persekutuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan dan\ndaerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 4) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the\nPrice Control and Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [Act 723], the Controller, with the approval\nof the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-8"};
